{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026398qzZKnLx1795015120.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>兩間二手名牌寄賣店懷疑拖欠寄賣品及款項，並且失去聯絡，最新累計逾200人報案，涉款共3,800萬元。</p><p></p><p>涉案的包括銅鑼灣羅素街的「VOOTIC」，及金鐘夏慤道的「樂星」，截至傍晚6時，警方分別接獲140人及76人報案，稱店舖懷疑拖欠寄賣款項。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FRAUD-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026K6bWatFYoJ1795015226.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>案件暫列欺詐，灣仔及中區警區重案組正在跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T16:24:39.506510+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T15:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T11:50:01.640802+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T16:17:42.961481+00:00","content_hash":"007bf3a954f1c836aac4ffa371b59588f0e747b6a3de58b29d88e844cfc286fe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T16:24:39.506510+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}